  "decision_summary": "The query is aripiprazole, an arylpiperazine dihydroquinolinone. The closest analogue brexpiprazole has 95% absolute oral bioavailability in humans, and other arylpiperazine drugs such as urapidil (72-78%), trazodone (63-91%), and flibanserin (33-46%) all exceed the 20% threshold. The mixed physicochemical prior is outweighed by consistent experimental evidence supporting high oral bioavailability.",
